ubuntuguard (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix SSH hardening precedence: write sshd_config.d/00-ubuntuguard.conf so
    cloud-init drop-ins cannot override PasswordAuthentication.
  * Skip ssh reload when the service is inactive instead of failing apply.
  * Add real-systemd integration test (ufw/auditd/AIDE) to CI.

